     "text": "In September 1986, the Belgrade newspaper Večernje novosti published excerpts from a leaked draft by members of the Serbian Academy of Sciences and Arts. It argued that Serbs were discriminated against in Yugoslavia, especially in Kosovo and Croatia.",
